      "text": "TRAFFIC ADVISORY: #KCCAatWork is still onsite along Sixth Street in the Industrial Area. \nThis stretch remains completely closed off to allow for proper execution of with concrete works.\n\nWe urge motorists and the public to follow on-site traffic guidance for safe navigation during this period.\n\n5th street and all the adjacent connecting streets within the area remain the primary alternative access routes to all areas served by the closed road.\n\nAll inconvenience is highly regretted.\n\n#ForALivableCity",
